ounty"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids shows August to September under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle ran 155% of normal in April to May and 68% in January to February. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 56% on the middle. Every grid had its driest year in 1965, down to 62% on grid 26631.</p>"}
